functions:
public succ: bitstring -> bitstring
public msg: bitstring

agents: A B

knowledge: 
A knows A B sk(A,B).
B knows A B sk(A,B).

choreo:

A: new NA.
A->B: (A,scrypt(NA,sk(A,B))).
B: new NB.
B->A: scrypt((succ(NA),NB),sk(A,B)).
A->B: scrypt(succ(NB),sk(A,B)).
B: new NB2.
B->A: scrypt((msg,NB2),sk(A,B)). #format added because proverif fails analysis otherwise
A weakly authenticates B on NB2. #true
NB2 secret between A B. #true
end